{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2022-11-17 07:00:00', 'title': 'NAMOCELL HIGHLIGHTED IN NATURE PUBLICATION FOR EFFICIENT SINGLE CELL CLONING OF HUMAN PLURIPOTENT STEM CELLS', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS , NOV. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PUBLICATION OF A SINGLE-CELL CLONING WORKFLOW STUDY USING THE NAMOCELL™ SINGLE CELL DISPENSER IN NATURE PROTOCOLS:\xa0EFFICIENT AND SAFE SINGLE-CELL CLONING OF HUMAN PLURIPOTENT STEM CELLS USING THE CHROMAN 1, EMRICASAN, POLYAMINES, AND TRANS-ISRIB (CEPT) COCKTAIL . THIS PUBLICATION OUTLINES A ROBUST AND SCALABLE WORKFLOW FOR CLONING HUMAN PLURIPOTENT STEM CELLS (HPSCS) THAT MAXIMIZES THE VIABILITY OF THE CELLS USING THE NAMOCELL SINGLE CELL DISPENSER.'}